{
  "_readme": [
    "DEFAULT layout — the standard base every game layout inherits from.",
    "",
    "This is the tested Squadrons-style mapping: throttle on the left stick Y",
    "(so it can never fire a weapon), flight stick on lx/ry, twist on rx.",
    "Game layouts override only what differs and inherit the rest.",
    "",
    "layout_switch_button (T2, the lower half of the first T-rocker) cycles",
    "through all layouts in 'order'; the active one shows on the throttle MFD",
    "as its short_name. suspend_button (E) freezes the throttle for menus.",
    "",
    "Edit this file (or any layout) from the web editor:  http://<pi-ip>:8088"
  ],
  "display_name": "Default",
  "short_name": "DEFAULT",
  "order": 0,
  "device_match": "X52",
  "hat_to_dpad": true,
  "throttle_axis": "ABS_Z",
  "brightness_axis": "ABS_RY",
  "led_brightness_axis": "ABS_RX",
  "suspend_button": "BTN_BASE2",
  "layout_switch_button": "BTN_BASE4",
  "axes": {
    "ABS_X":  { "target": "lx", "invert": false, "deadzone": 0.08, "expo": 0.2 },
    "ABS_Y":  { "target": "ry", "invert": true,  "deadzone": 0.08, "expo": 0.2 },
    "ABS_RZ": { "target": "rx", "invert": false, "deadzone": 0.12, "expo": 0.3 },
    "ABS_Z":  { "target": "ly", "invert": true,  "deadzone": 0.03, "expo": 0.0 }
  },
  "buttons": {
